|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Helpdesk | 6/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% | 74% / 68% | $5.05 |
| Crm | 6/6 | 5/6 | 6/6 | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% | 66% / 71% | $4.29 |

